speed\":\"standard\"},\"modelUsage\":{\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\":{\"inputTokens\":787,\"outputTokens\":17,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":0,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.000872,\"contextWindow\":200000,\"maxOutputTokens\":32000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-haiku-4-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"},\"claude-sonnet-5\":{\"inputTokens\":36,\"outputTokens\":4195,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":642277,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":25600,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.40931610000000007,\"contextWindow\":1000000,\"maxOutputTokens\":64000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-sonnet-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"}},\"permission_denials\":[],\"terminal_reason\":\"completed\",\"fast_mode_state\":\"off\",\"fast_mode_disabled_reason\":\"sdk_opt_in_required\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"api_error_status\":null,\"result\":\"All export/checkpoint tests pass.\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nFound the regression by tracing `BranchesFor` (`internal/cli/export.go`) through git history via `git log --all -S\\\"BranchesFor\\\"`. Commit `125ab7d` (\\\"Export branch-scoped session logs with authors\\\") checked default-branch reachability (`DefaultCheckpointIDs`) **first**, only falling back to the checkpoint's recorded metadata branch when the checkpoint wasn't reachable from the default branch. That ordering had been inverted, so any checkpoint carrying a non-empty (stale) feature-branch label was filed under that old branch folder even after the branch merged into default.\\n\\n**Fix:** restored the original precedence in `BranchesFor` \u2014 check `DefaultCheckpointIDs` first and only fall back to `metadataBranch` if the checkpoint isn't reachable from default. `SourceBranch` provenance tracking (`addSelectedSession`) was already correct and untouched, so the original branch is still remembered even when the session is grouped under default.\\n\\n**Validation:** `go test ./internal/cli/ -run 'TestExport|BranchesFor|Branch'` and `go test ./internal/cli/ -run 'Export|Checkpoint'` both pass (all green, no failures).\\n\\nNo changes to go.mod/go.sum, no test edits, nothing committed.\",\"ttft_ms\":1385,\"ttft_stream_ms\":826,\"time_to_request_ms\":12,\"type\":\"result\",\"duration_ms\":83781,\"uuid\":\"4a926a09-4bc2-4fe4-b476-26d10666fcc3\"}\n",
